  "rendered": "The solids content of NMC 532 slurries made with NMP is 45 wt%. Replacing the PVDF binder with PVDF latex and CMC increases the solids content to 65 wt%. \n\nThe primary drying time for a graphite coating with a loading of 10 mg/cm^2 made with NMP processing is 51 s. The primary drying time for a graphite coating with a loading of 10 mg/cm^2 made with water-based processing is 34 s. \n\nThe higher solids content cuts the primary drying time by 33% (51 s - 34 s = 17 s, 17 s / 51 s = 0.33, 1 - 0.33 = 0.67, 1 - 0.67 = 0.33).",
